<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Levi was faithful to God,</l><l>And he was separated from the world.</l><l>We spend time in the presence of the Lord—</l><l>We’re the priests of God today!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Judah stepped up for his brothers,</l><l>Loving them and honoring his father.</l><l>God limits us so we can reign as kings,</l><l>Then we can enjoy God’s flow!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
